<title>UK: Friends Provident Q1 new business up 73 percent.</title>
<headline>Friends Provident Q1 new business up 73 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Friends Provident Group said its new business grew by 73 percent in the first quarter to 253.2 million stg from 146.5 million in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The group's retail financial services operation increased new business in the first quarter of 1997 by 35 percent to 158.5 million stg.</p>
<p>The mutually owned insurer said its asset management business saw sales increase to 94.7 million stg in the first quarter, up from 29.0 million in the first quarter 1996.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
